  (text "SHARED I2C BUS & MCP23017 PANEL NOTES (docs/WIRING.md §6.3, HW_VERIFY G1-G9)\n- I2C Pull-Ups: ESP32-P4-ETH PCB has R44/R46 = 2.2kOhm -> ESP_3V3.\n  SSCI-016506 has R1/R2 unpopulated; verify OLED module PU & combined R [G3].\n- I2C Addresses: TC358743=0x0F [ok], MCP23017=0x20, SSD1306=0x3C/0x3D, ES8311=? [G2].\n- SSCI-016506 INTA/INTB/~RESET are NOT exposed on module header (internal 10k+0.1uF\n  on /RESET); polling operation only. SW1..SW5 use MCP23017 internal 100k pull-ups.\n- OLED-3 display policy: 30s auto-off, no I2C traffic when OFF, 1Hz dirty-page update.\n- NEVER route ATX (A0/A1/~E_*) or KVM LED truth inputs through MCP23017!" (exclude_from_sim no)
    (at 21.59 204.47 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35) (color 20 50 120 1.0)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "aa7a513a-6fc0-5897-aeab-0f8815167e6e")
  )
